mportant  information though it is you know i'm  not knocking it out  i think it's important to  to really understand the do's and the  domes and really avoid the don'ts so  that we can keep our babies and that's  why it's such a dire situation because  there's not a lot of avenues that  parents can take if they're in a crisis  just like the value of the  formula on the shelves this information  is just as valuable so we appreciate you  coming this morning dr alana levine  thank you so much

